      "title": "AJANTPHARM: Audit Oversight And Refined Assumptions Will Support Future Returns",
      "body": "Ajanta Pharma's analyst price target remains at ₹3,742, as analysts fine tune their assumptions around discount rate, revenue growth, profit margin and future P/E to reflect a slightly different risk and earnings profile without altering the overall valuation outcome. What's in the News Board meeting scheduled for May 5, 2026 to consider audited financial results for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026, along with audited financial statements for the full year (Key Developments).",
