      "title": "Ajanta Pharma Limited Just Beat Revenue Estimates By 5.0%",
      "body": "Investors in Ajanta Pharma Limited ( NSE:AJANTPHARM ) had a good week, as its shares rose 9.1% to close at ₹3,078...",
